# RESULTS.md and results-reference/ ARE committed. A benchmark that ships without the
# data behind its claims is a press release; shipping the raw JSONL is what lets someone
# disagree with a specific number instead of the whole thing.
# Refresh with: python -m scripts.export_reference_results && python -m bench.cli report

